{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284190","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028419001:0":{"text":"セオドアの話によると、彼は二人をこの分かれ道まで送ってきて、ここで分かれたということでした。","source_cn":"西奥多说他把两位植物学家送到了这个路口，才和他们分开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCD471D0DA3876B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028419002:1":{"text":"変だなぁ。さっき採集部隊を探しに来た時、ターラン村に向かう足跡なんてなかったのに。","source_cn":"奇怪，之前找采集队的时候，满满没看到有足迹往塔兰村去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA664F7DF8872B5FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028419003:1":{"text":"こんなにたくさん足跡があるんだもの。見落としてても無理はないわ。","source_cn":"明明路上有很多足迹，你是不是看错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BB6C265A9ACF7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028419004:1":{"text":"見落とすものか！ロンロンは方向には自信があるんだから！","source_cn":"满满才不会看错呢！方向满满还是能认清楚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE795A2A84B106DBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028419005:2":{"text":"……やっぱり二人は本当に道を間違えて、どこか遠くに行ってしまったのでしょうか？","source_cn":"……难道那两位植物学家难道真走错了路，跑到更远的岔路上了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27922DCDCBEF9186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028419006:1":{"text":"この距離で道に迷うなんて、二人はこの辺の人じゃないということでしょうか？ロンロンでもターラン村に戻る道はまだ覚えていますよ！","source_cn":"这样都能迷路，他们还是不是本地人？连满满都还记得回塔兰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF23D36F14F7E46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028419007:1":{"text":"……ロンロンさんの言うことも一理ありますね。ヴェルディアの植物学者なら年中森に入り浸っているはずです。そんなよく知る場所で道に迷うなんて、確かにおかしいです。","source_cn":"……满满说的其实有些道理，绿裔的植物学者常年泡在森林里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF253A37532DA8078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028419008:1":{"text":"とにかく、探しに行きましょう。","source_cn":"不过，我们还是先去找人吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D841D9A645BB300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}